  "title": "Low-poly flat shading with per-facet colour",
  "purpose": "Give any mesh a faceted low-poly look: per-pixel face normals from screen derivatives, per-facet colour variation from a hash of the face normal, a height gradient, and optional vertex jitter to break up regular primitives.",
